---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Cta from '../components/Cta.astro';
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import { serviceImages } from '../data/images';
import { business } from '../data/site';
---
<Layout title="The recording studio in Deep Ellum" description="Take a look inside Legacy Music Group, a recording studio and production company on Main Street in Deep Ellum, Dallas. Find location, equipment and booking details."><div class="shell"><header class="page-heading"><p class="eyebrow">2815 Main Street / Deep Ellum</p><h1>A place to<br /><em>make your mark.</em></h1><p>Recording and production, rooted in Dallas. Legacy gives the music a place to happen.</p></header><Image class="studio-photo" src={serviceImages.room} widths={[480,768,1024]} sizes="(max-width:1440px) 92vw, 1312px" format="webp" quality={85} alt="Legacy Music Group’s A Room, including the control desk, monitoring setup and seating" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" /><section class="section service-body"><div><p class="eyebrow">The studio</p><h2>Music comes first.</h2><p>Legacy Music Group is a full-service recording studio and production company in Deep Ellum, owned and operated by Matthew Medlock. The studio’s published services cover recording, mixing, mastering and custom production.</p><p>The photographs here are from Legacy’s own published studio website.</p><div class="inline-links"><a class="text-link" href="/gear/">Explore the equipment</a><a class="text-link" href="/engineers/">Choose an engineer</a></div></div><div><p class="eyebrow">Come find us</p><h2>Made on<br /><em>Main Street.</em></h2><p>{business.address}<br />{business.city}</p><p>Confirm arrival instructions with the studio before your session. Check posted parking signs and current local restrictions when you arrive.</p><a class="button secondary" href={business.mapsUrl}>Get directions ↗</a></div></section></div><Cta /></Layout>
